ng the age-specific state populations\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the state's potentially preventable deaths were set to zero.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The method used tends to slightly overestimate the number of potentially preventable deaths.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}